e:65px;\"><span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:65px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">The Problem</span></span></span></span></p>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-m5y6vq0e6":{"html":"<h2 class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:56px; line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:56px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">This is a title.</span></span></h2>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-m5y6vq0e13":{"html":"<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:1.8em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Our Client faced critical challenges in their order processing workflows:</span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Slow manual processes</span></span>, with each order taking up to 90 minutes to process.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Low accuracy rates</span></span> (59% on first attempts), leading to frequent errors and inefficiencies.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Inconsistent margins, resulting in <span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">revenue losses</span></span>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Complex product configurations</span></span>, adding difficulty to pricing and order management.</span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">These issues hindered their scalability and overall operational efficiency.</span></p>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-m5y6vq0f9":{"meshProps":{"wedges":[],"rotatedComponents":[],"fixedComponents":[]},"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-m5y6vq0f9","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shouldRenderUnderlay":true,"shouldPadMedia":false,"hasCanvasAnimation":false},"a11y":{"tabindex":"-1"},"dividers":{"hasTopDivider":false,"hasBottomDivider":false},"translations":{"playLabel":"Play","pauseLabel":"Pause"}},"comp-m5y6vq0g1":{"dividers":{"hasTopDivider":false,"hasBottomDivider":false},"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-m5y6vq0g1","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shouldRenderUnderlay":true,"shouldPadMedia":false,"hasCanvasAnimation":false}},"comp-m5y6vq0g8":{"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-m5y6vq0g8","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shouldRenderUnderlay":true,"shouldPadMedia":false,"hasCanvasAnimation":fa