s=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">The Solution</span></span></span></span></p>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-m5y6vq0l6":{"html":"<h2 class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:56px; line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:56px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">This is a title.</span></span></h2>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-m5y6vq0m3":{"html":"<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Tailored Salesforce CPQ System:</span></span></span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Implemented a customized Salesforce CPQ solution designed to handle complex product configurations, pricing rules, and discount structures.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Allowed dealers to self-service their quotes, reducing internal workload and enabling the sales team to focus on strategic activities.</span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Seamless ERP Integration (JDEdwards):</span></span></span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Integrated Salesforce CPQ with JDEdwards, enabling real-time data synchronization for pricing, inventory, and order management.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Streamlined operations across the sales and fulfillment processes, ensuring consistency and reducing errors.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-m5y6vq0m11":{"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-m5y6vq0m11","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shouldRenderUnderlay":true,"shouldPadMedia":false,"hasCanvasAnimation":false},"meshProps":{"wedges":[],"rotatedComponents":[],"fixedComponents":[]},"columnOverrides":{"width":"100%","contentArea":{"alignment":0.5,"width":360}},"translations":{"ariaLabel":"content changes on hover"}},"comp-m5y6vq0n5":{"meshProps":{"wedges":[],"rotatedComponents":[],"fixedComponents":[]},"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-m5y6vq0n5","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shouldRenderUnderlay":true,"shouldPadMedia":false,"hasCanvasAnimation":false},"a11y":{"tabindex":"-1"},"dividers":{"hasTopDivider":false,"hasBottomDivider":false},"translations":{"playLabel":"Play","pauseLabel":"Pause"}},"comp-m5y6vq0o4":{"html":"<h2 class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:56px; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:56px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">The Results</span></span></h2>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fu